<title>UK: Credit Local sets $200 mln Dec 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets $200 mln Dec 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CIBC Wood Gundy.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CRDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    31.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.37    PAY DATE    07.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.77     SPREAD	+19 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMS US/GB/CA/FR</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
